{"ID":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","title":"9.6","type":"doc","updated":"20260906161601"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260906161559-hcvo72a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-hcvo72a","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash反馈工具"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-qdr8dpk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-qdr8dpk","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体概览"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-0wbmi7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-0wbmi7h","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析规则引擎，整体可以概括成一条流水线：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输入扫描与预筛、Crash 分组、代表样本深度采证、按优先级执行规则、专项分析、结果汇总和 UI 展示。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-upvpd0n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-upvpd0n","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"输入准备"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n用户选择单个 dump，也可以选择 zip 包或混合输入，系统会先统一输入格式\n在后台 Isolate 中解压，避免阻塞 UI，同时做 Zip Slip 路径校验\n随后扫描 dump 文件，跳过 caton_dump 这类卡顿目录，并通过 SHA-1 去重\n对候选 dump 先执行 quick_triage，提取异常码、故障桶、栈信息和模块信息，完成一次轻量级预筛\n最多保留5个Crash 样本，减少后续 CDB 深度分析的开销"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-qzpb4rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-qzpb4rb","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Crash 签名进行分组"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n签名主要由异常码、故障地址、故障模块和关键栈信息等内容共同决定，相同或高度相似的 Crash 会归到同一组\n每组只选择一个代表 dump 做深度采证，这样既能避免重复分析，也能保留批量 Crash 的整体分布\n深度采证层通过REST API调用 CDB，依次获取异常信息、模块列表、内存摘要、异常上下文和调用栈，随后执行 !analyze -v\n栈帧获取还有多级降级策略：优先使用结构化结果，如果结构化结果缺失，就依次使用过滤后的栈、预筛阶段的栈\n最后再解析原始 kb 文本，保证部分命令失败时流程仍然可以继续"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-gpqmxwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-gpqmxwh","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"规则引擎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n采用“先命中、先返回”的短路逻辑\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"最前面的规则负责识别确定性更高、影响更大的问题："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n例如异常码缺失、堆损坏、函数指针异常、硬件故障桶、进程主动退出、Crashpad 主动上报、CEF 环境异常，以及磁盘、DLP、杀毒软件导致的 STATUS_IN_PAGE_ERROR。\n针对 Intel 13/14 代 Raptor Lake CPU，还会单独检查控制流失控、IP_ON_HEAP、特权指令异常等 CPU 缺陷信号。\n这样做的目的是先排除硬件、环境和进程主动退出等特殊情况，避免后面的模块归因覆盖掉更准确的结论。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-0cyxnz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-0cyxnz7","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果前面的专项规则没有命中，系统会进入栈和模块归因阶段。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n首先会过滤系统透明模块、去除递归重复帧，构造用户态调用栈\n如果没有有效用户帧，还会检查栈溢出、Hook、IAT 损坏或未知注入模块\n然后优先检查栈顶用户帧：如果栈顶模块属于第三方厂商名册，就直接认为第三方模块是高优先级嫌疑对象\n如果栈顶没有命中，再扫描前 20 个用户帧寻找第三方模块\n配置中的第三方厂商、企微自身 DLL、系统透明模块以及场景关键词都来自 config.json 的 crash_knowledge 配置\n规则本身和业务数据是分离的，后续维护厂商名册时不需要大规模修改代码"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-sp6b7qh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-sp6b7qh","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三方判断并不是简单地“栈里出现过就归因”"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n引擎还会结合异常码、场景关键词、模块加载情况和模块出现位置进行交叉判断\n比如栈顶是未知模块时，会优先保留未知模块结论，避免深层的已知第三方模块误导归因；\n如果第三方模块和未知模块交替穿插，也会降低置信度或标记为复杂注入场景\n未知模块则会按照出现频次排序，默认提取 Top 3 作为重点嫌疑模块\n如果确认是第三方模块但缺少 DLL 路径，编排器会额外执行 lmvm 补查模块路径，\n再把补充后的证据重新送回规则引擎进行二次归因"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-sabiz6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-sabiz6b","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"如果没有第三方或未知模块命中，最后才判断是否属于企微自身模块"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n企微模块命中时，会结合调用栈连续性、异常类型以及是否存在内存破坏来评估可信度\n因为一旦发生堆损坏或栈损坏，调用栈本身可能已经不可靠，所以不能仅凭最后一帧就断言是企微自身问题\n整个规则链最后还有 R8 兜底规则，无法确定责任模块时统一归类为未知模块或无法分析\n并保留现有证据，而不是强行给出一个看似确定但实际不可靠的结论"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-q4nn2a4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-q4nn2a4","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"内存问题和 CPU 问题属于跨 dump 的专项分析"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n内存分析器会扫描日志中的 [Memory]、VirtualAvaliable、[sys] 和 [MemoryInspector] 等信息\n区分系统整体 OOM、企微虚拟地址耗尽和日志数据不足三种情况\n如果日志证据不完整，也会结合 dump 中的硬证据进行判断\nCPU 缺陷分析则先确认是否为 Intel 13/14 代 Raptor Lake\n再综合观察 Crash 是否分散发生、地址 bit31 是否翻转、寄存器中的小整数是否异常翻转，以及数据库损坏次数\n崩溃分散度、地址翻转和数据库损坏属于强信号，可以直接或高权重支持 CPU 缺陷结论\nCRT 或普通堆损坏属于弱信号，通常需要和其他证据叠加，避免误判"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-iemtznf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-iemtznf","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"最后"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n编排器会把每个 Crash 组的分类、置信度、责任厂商、关联场景、证据链、客服话术、第三方模块、未知模块和耗时封装成 LocalAnalysisResult\n再通过 GroupSummary 做跨组汇总\n对于明确的 OOM，系统还可以提前终止后续分组分析，并把未处理的分组标记为 oom_batch_skipped\n结果经过统一分类枚举和置信度钳位后，由 CrashAnalysisManager 更新状态、处理超时取消和归档，最后由 crash_analysis_window 监听状态并展示总体结论、分组结果、内存分析和模块证据"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-qzmqvjm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-qzmqvjm","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深度采证结构体"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-sc083p2","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-sc083p2","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"ZGFydA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"class DeepCollectionResult {\n  // ===== 基本标识 =====\n  final String dumpSha1;              // dump 文件 SHA1 指纹\n  final String dumpFilePath;          // dump 本地路径\n  final int elapsedMs;                // 深度采证总耗时(ms)\n\n  // ===== 异常信息（来自 exception_info preset + 降级） =====\n  final String? exceptionCode;        // 异常码，如 0xc0000005\n  final String? exceptionAddress;     // 异常指令地址\n  final String? exceptionModule;      // 异常模块名（三级降级推断：!analyze→栈顶→null）\n  final String? exceptionDescription; // 异常描述文本\n  final DateTime? dumpTime;           // dump 生成时间\n\n  // ===== 调用栈（四级降级策略） =====\n  final List\u003cStackFrame\u003e stackFrames; // 栈帧列表，每帧含：\n                                      //   frameIndex, moduleName, functionName,\n                                      //   fullSymbol, framePointer, returnAddress\n\n  // ===== 模块列表（来自 module_list preset） =====\n  final List\u003cLoadedModule\u003e loadedModules; // 已加载模块，每模块含：\n                                          //   name(去后缀), fullName, path,\n                                          //   startAddress, endAddress, version, companyName\n\n  // ===== !analyze -v 解析字段 =====\n  final String? faultingModule;       // !analyze 归因的故障模块名\n  final String? failureBucketId;      // 崩溃桶 ID\n  final String? analyzeVOutput;       // !analyze -v 原始文本\n\n  // ===== 其他证据 =====\n  final String? crashRegistersRaw;    // .ecxr; kb 原始文本（CPU 位翻转判定用）\n  final Map\u003cString, dynamic\u003e? memorySummary; // !address -summary 结果（内存概览）\n  final String? lastStatusValue;      // LAST_STATUS_VALUE（如 0xc000012d = 系统级 OOM 硬证据）\n  final int? lastError;               // LAST_ERROR_CODE（Win32 错误码十进制）\n\n  // ===== 执行状态 =====\n  final bool allCommandsSucceeded;    // 所有 CDB 命令是否执行成功\n  final List\u003cString\u003e failedCommands;  // 失败的命令列表\n}\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-ut88tng","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-ut88tng","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"规则引擎详细"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-1cq5t0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-1cq5t0x","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拿到 exception_info、!analyze -v、调用栈和模块列表后，我"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"不会简单地根据栈顶模块下结论"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n而是按照固定优先级逐层分析\n首先"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"确认异常码和基础调用栈是否可用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\n模块列表为空时不会立即放弃，因为它属于辅助证据，但最终归因时必须明确说明证据不足，避免过度判断。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-247lm8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-247lm8f","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一步是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"识别异常类型和内存破坏信号"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n比如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"0xC0000374"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 表示"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"堆损坏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"0xC0000005"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 只有在 AV.Fault=Execute(执行访问违例并尝试跳过去执行，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"函数指针被破坏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")\n并且异常模块为空或属于企业微信模块时，才会进一步认为可能存在函数指针被破坏、跳转到非法地址执行的情况。\n这些结果主要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"作为内存破坏 标记"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，后续会影响第三方模块和企业微信自身模块的归因置信度"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-blroeqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-blroeqr","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来，首先"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"检查 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"FAILURE_BUCKET_ID"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，如果是纯 hardware_ 故障桶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，可以直接倾向硬件问题；\n但"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果同时包含 software 或 application_fault"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，说明 WinDbg 的判断存在歧义，就要继续结合其他证据分析\n对于 0x40000015，它表示 STATUS_FATAL_APP_EXIT，也就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"进程主动因为不可恢复错误退出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n我会继续检查 _purecall、abort、terminate、_invalid_parameter 和 bad_alloc 等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" CRT 致命函数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n判断是未捕获异常、对象生命周期错误、参数错误还是内存分配失败。（区分企微进程主动退出的具体类型）\n对于企业微信 Crashpad 的自定义异常码 0xFFF00F01\n我会把 Crashpad 模块视为异常捕获和上报模块，而不是直接当成根因。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-rk3p5hw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-rk3p5hw","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"CEF 相关崩溃"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n则要求断点异常"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 0x80000003 和 libcef、chrome_elf 等 CEF 模块关联"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，同时结合 FAILURE_BUCKET_ID "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"以及前 10 帧中是否出现 LoadLocalState、ResourceBundle、DataPack 等资源初始化函数"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，判断是否可能是浏览器内核资源文件损坏、缺失或初始化环境异常。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-9090sla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-9090sla","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color)); background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background));"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"页面加载或磁盘 I/O 异常"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color)); background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（对于 0xC0000006、0xC000009C、0xC000009D 这类）\n我会重点区分软件过滤驱动和物理存储故障。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"首先检查进程环境中是否存在 DLP、磁盘加密、杀毒软件等磁盘过滤模块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\n如果没有相关模块，整体上更倾向于磁盘或存储硬件问题\n如果存在过滤模块，还要结合异常码和调用栈判断：\n磁盘错误码配合 Windows.Globalization 等输入法或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"系统读取链路时，可以高置信度判定硬件或存储问题"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\n如果证据不足，则不会直接把责任归给某个安全软件，而是保留“过滤驱动干扰或磁盘故障”的低置信度结论\n对于 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"skip"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"S3 的情况，也会走硬件方向的低置信度兜底，避免继续通过普通第三方模块规则误判。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-vt9sebd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-vt9sebd","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果调用栈为空或用户态栈无法构造，我还会检查一些特殊场景。\n例如 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"0xC00000FD 栈溢出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结合 DLP、Hook 或未知模块时，可能是第三方注入导致栈异常；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"0xC0000005 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的调用链中如果出现 CreateProcess、ShellExecute 等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"进程创建路径"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，则会检查是否存在 IAT Hook；\n函数指针异常同时伴随 DLP 或 Hook 模块时，也会降低企业微信自身归因的置信度。\n未知模块不能因为只出现一帧就完全忽略，尤其要关注它是否位于最靠近崩溃点的位置。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-mo3y5c3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-mo3y5c3","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"专项规则都没有命中后，才进入普通模块归因流程。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n我会先"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"过滤透明模块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"( ntdll、系统运行库等)，再"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"去除递归重复帧"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，构造有效的用户态调用栈。\n之后优先看栈顶用户帧，因为它最接近实际崩溃位置；如果栈顶是未知模块，就不会被调用链更深处的已知第三方模块“劫持归因”。如果栈顶是企业微信模块，则进一步扫描前面若干帧，检查是否存在已知第三方模块、未知注入模块，或者是否命中了输入法、Hook、DLP 等场景关联规则。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-af4pvqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-af4pvqd","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"对于堆损坏或函数指针异常，我不会只看第一帧就判断责任方，而是评估调用链是否可信"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n跳过堆函数和系统受害者帧后，如果企业微信模块连续出现至少 3 帧，可以认为调用路径更支持企业微信自身代码问题；\n如果第三方模块连续出现至少 3 帧，则更倾向于第三方模块破坏内存或注入影响；\n如果两边都没有达到连续帧阈值，就返回 unable_to_analyze 或降低置信度，因为栈可能已经被破坏，无法可靠归因。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-xsqm1dr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-xsqm1dr","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最后，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果栈中出现未识别模块，我会按照出现频次进行排序"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n并结合模块路径、是否靠近栈顶以及是否处于已知第三方列表中，输出高嫌疑模块。\n正常的企业微信栈顶但同时存在未知模块时，也会优先提示第三方 Hook 或注入风险；\n如果没有第三方或未知模块证据，才会把问题归为企业微信自身模块问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-ova6wu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-ova6wu7","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于 Raptor Lake 这类 CPU 疑似缺陷，单次 dump 主要关注 IP_ON_HEAP、0xC0000096 等信号；\n批量分析时还会结合崩溃地址是否分散、地址或寄存器是否存在 bit 翻转、数据库是否反复损坏，以及 CRT 损坏和堆损坏是否叠加出现，避免仅凭一次崩溃就认定是硬件缺陷。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-qwnnv12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-qwnnv12","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"总体来说，这套规则的核心原则是：先处理确定性高的硬件、I/O、主动退出、CEF 和控制流异常，再进行第三方模块和企业微信自身模块归因；对于证据不足、栈被破坏或多个结论冲突的情况，宁可降低置信度或返回无法分析，也不做武断归因。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-pf69eg7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-pf69eg7","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"S4的场景判断"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-b49zg8g","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||","id":"20260906161559-b49zg8g","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"场景"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"触发条件"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关联第三方类别"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文本输入场景"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"text"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"input"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调用栈出现文本输入、断词、自动纠正等相关关键词，并且进程加载了输入法模块"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入法软件"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存页 I/O 错误"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"io"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"error"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异常码匹配内存页 I/O 错误，并且进程加载了相关安全软件模块"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数据防泄漏软件、磁盘加密软件、杀毒软件"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hook 注入崩溃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"hook"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"crash"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调用栈出现 Hook、Detour、拦截、跳板等关键词，并且进程加载了相关安全软件模块"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"杀毒软件、数据防泄漏软件、终端检测与响应软件、终端安全软件、监控软件"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"TSF/MSCTF 焦点回调崩溃"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"tsf"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"focus"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"crash"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"调用栈出现系统文本服务、输入法焦点或窗口回调等关键词，并且进程加载了相关第三方模块"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入法软件、系统输入法组件、数据防泄漏软件、杀毒软件、终端检测与响应软件、终端安全软件、监控软件"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"未知模块与第三方模块穿插"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"hook"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"interleave"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"前 20 个有效用户态栈帧中，某个非企微模块至少出现 3 次，疑似存在 Hook 或注入"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"已知第三方模块或未知模块"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"I/O 场景兜底"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"S4‑D"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"I/O 错误相关场景跳过 S3，且 S4、S4‑C 都未命中时触发"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可能涉及数据防泄漏、磁盘加密、杀毒软件，也可能是硬件或存储故障"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-uvpfeeo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-uvpfeeo","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0xC0000005 表示访问违例"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-6br7izx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-6br7izx","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"读取了无效地址\n向无效地址写数据\n从无效地址执行代码"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-l6fu5zx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-l6fu5zx","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入法注入导致的堆破坏"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-n8w6co4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-n8w6co4","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根本原因在于"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"内存破坏的错误具有延迟暴露"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"特性，即\"写入\"与\"崩溃\"在时间和代码位置上完全分离"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-57nkz6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-57nkz6r","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三方注入模块破坏堆时，写入的是堆管理器的元数据或对象的虚表指针，而非自身的数据\n所谓元数据，是指堆管理器为了管理各个堆块而维护的账本信息：\n每个堆块的数据区前部都附有一个块头，记录该块的 Size、Flags、PreviousSize 等字段；\n若该块处于空闲状态，其数据区还会被复用，存放空闲链表中的双向指针 Flink / Blink"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-hh0v97z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-hh0v97z","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以典型越界写为例，注入模块申请了一块 100 字节的缓冲区，却写入了 200 字节\n超出边界的部分便直接覆盖了紧邻其后的下一个堆块的块头，篡改了其 Size 与 Flags\n若相邻块为空闲块，还会连带覆盖 Flink / Blink 指针\n这一写入发生在合法的可写内存区间，且被改写的账本字段此刻不会被立即读取\n因此不触发任何处理器异常，函数得以正常返回并退栈"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-5o9c2w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-5o9c2w8","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"崩溃则发生在下一次堆内存的分配/释放或虚函数调用时\n企微自身的正常逻辑沿损坏的元数据执行解引用——分配或释放时依据被篡改的 Size 定位下一块、或顺着被覆盖的 Flink / Blink 遍历空闲链表，访问到非法的目标地址，从而触发崩溃。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-isrihuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-isrihuf","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这一时序错位带来了归因上的典型风险：仅凭栈顶归属判定根因，会将受害方误判为责任方。\n为此，归因逻辑不能简单信任栈顶，而应回溯调用链，检查是否存在第三方模块的连续残留帧——若第三方连续出现达到阈值，可判定其为主因；\n若痕迹不连续或栈已被破坏导致结构紊乱，则不宜给出高置信结论，应将置信度降级并标注内存破坏特征，交由人工复核。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-vfsfyz9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-vfsfyz9","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用于crash分析的skills怎么做的"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-1ml5054","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-1ml5054","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"给一个 Windows 崩溃附件包，自动化出一份归因报告。\n链路是\"解压 → 读元数据 → CDB 分析 → 日志印证 → 归因 → 出报告\"，核心思想是分层取证、逐级降级。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-4xw7n8c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-4xw7n8c","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"具体实现上分两个 Python 脚本。\n  "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"dump_helper.py，负责"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文件操作"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\nprepare 子命令解压 zip 后按体积降序列出所有 dmp，体积最大的就是主进程 dump；\nupload 子命令用标准库流式 PUT 上传 dump 到 MCP 服务端\n专门规避 PowerShell 里 curl 是 Invoke-WebRequest 别名的坑。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"crash_context.py，负责"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"上下文分析"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\nmeta — 读元数据 JSON，给你挑重点：CPU 型号、服务端符号化好的栈、崩溃时间、设备 ID。自动算进程运行时长，顺手处理了启动时间是 UTC 而崩溃时间是本地时间的时区差。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-pqx5us4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-pqx5us4","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"logs — 拿崩溃时间做锚点，把包里日志按时间窗口分成四类，只有刚好覆盖崩溃那一刻的能当证据。同时自动标出混进来的其他案例目录，防止分析错对象。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-r9098a4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-r9098a4","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"grep — 在能用的日志里做关键词搜索，自动跳过加密日志和无关目录，返回结构化结果方便跟 dump 对着看。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-qsx7v18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-qsx7v18","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最大的效率优化是\"先读元数据再决定要不要走 CDB\"。\n元数据里已经有服务端符号化好的完整栈和精确 CPU 型号，够用就跳过后面的上传和符号加载，省掉几分钟。只有需要寄存器值、堆内存、其他线程栈时才走 CDB。CDB 部分用 MCP 服务器封装，提供创建会话、执行命令、关闭会话这套工具，首轮 !analyze -v 就能拿到 80% 的结论。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-byal9yy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-byal9yy","updated":"20260906161601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"反馈工具插件化你打算怎么做"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-adq1iu1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-adq1iu1","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个引擎是「配置驱动的知识库 + 硬编码的职责链」\n知识层其实已经插件化了——第三方厂商名册、透明模块、场景规则全在 config.json 里\n加个 DLP 厂商改 JSON 就行，还能远程下发"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-2wmii4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-2wmii4n","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"插件化我主要做三件事。\n第一是把每个阶段抽成一个统一的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Stage 接口"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一个 id、一个 order 决定优先级、一个门控、一个 run 返回空就表示没命中交给下一个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\nanalyze() 就退化成一个 for 循环，谁先命中就返回\n最后统一走出口方法做证据聚合和话术拼装，这个出口现在已经有了，改造成本很低。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-ryrsl4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-ryrsl4z","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同时要把散落的参数收敛成一个上下文对象——现在 S3-A 要接七八个参数\nS1.7 还得专门返回一个结构体往回传 skipS3 这种副作用，很别扭\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"收敛之后新插件能读到全量上下文，也能往里挂自己的中间态，加规则再也不用改已有方法的签名"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-nptedof","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-nptedof","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二是配置和开关。\n除了"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"编译期一个显式的注册表保证顺序"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"background-color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-background-color, var(--b3-card-warning-background)); color: var(--b3-inline-builtin-warning-color, var(--b3-card-warning-color));\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我会把 stages 声明式写进配置\n配合工厂做开关——比如某个客户误报多了，远程把那条规则关掉，不用发版\n阈值也一样外置，现在扫描帧数 20、连续帧数 3 这些魔法数字散在代码里，抽出来后可以按灵敏度调档"}]},{"ID":"20260906161559-iqszt9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161559-iqszt9y","updated":"20260906161559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不过我得说清楚：\nDart 没反射、没有动态类加载，所以这是「配置驱动的编译期插件」，不是 jar 那种二进制热插拔\n另外把 CPU 缺陷分析、内存 OOM 扫描这类独立分析器固化成「结论覆写」插件，它们不进主链，只在最后按分类策略决定要不要覆盖主结论——以后加个显卡缺陷分析器，主管道一行都不用改。"}]},{"ID":"20260906161601-3fmmr5k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260906161601-3fmmr5k","updated":"20260906161601"}}]}